@startuml Service_Staff
!theme plain

actor Staff
participant "Frontend\nAdmin/src/pages/ServiceBookingsPage/ServiceBookingsPage.tsx" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n/src/controllers/serviceBookings.controller.ts" as API
database "MongoDB\n(Collection: serviceBookings, invoices)" as DB

Staff -> Frontend: Xem danh sách service bookings
Frontend -> API: (bộ lọc, phân trang)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role = staff
API -> DB: Query service bookings
DB --> API: Danh sách service bookings

API --> Frontend: Danh sách service bookings
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị danh sách

Staff -> Frontend: Cập nhật trạng thái service booking
Frontend -> API: (serviceBookingId, status)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role = staff
API -> DB: Cập nhật service booking status
DB --> API: Updated

API -> DB: Đồng bộ chi phí vào invoice
DB --> API: Invoice updated

API --> Frontend: Success
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị thành công
@enduml

